// ============================================
// QUERY: Insider Threat - Mass Download + Forwarding + New Country
// MITRE: T1048, T1114, T1078
// DESCRIPTION: User who downloaded files, set up forwarding, AND logged in from new country
// SEVERITY: Critical
// ============================================

